{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"GLOE共同主辦「ZETA DIVISION」SHAKA主辦的「LEGENDUS SHAKA ONE 2026」！由40名人氣實況主參加是歷年最多人數\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3154c88f742a536abce6ef0ca762bc7bc548424ec7f88df923d1e22a8edb2538/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa6d7c94ab49e5152939366730b23b528.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>GLOE共同主辦「ZETA DIVISION」SHAKA主辦的「LEGENDUS SHAKA ONE 2026」！由40名人氣實況主參加是歷年最多人數</figcaption></figure><p><strong>GLOE</strong>株式會社宣布，將與職業電競隊伍「ZETA DIVISION」共同於 2026年11月14日(六) 舉辦旗下創作者<strong>SHAKA</strong>主辦的線下活動「<strong>LEGENDUS SHAKA ONE 2026</strong>」。<br/>本次為第4屆，過去最多40名人氣實況主將參加。</p><h2>「LEGENDUS SHAKA ONE 2026」以總計40人舉辦！人氣實況主們將駕駛卡丁車奔馳</h2><blockquote><p></p><p>🏁LEGENDUS SHAKA ONE 2026 開催決定！</p><p>唸るタイヤ、繋ぐダイヤ。この走りに全てを賭けろ──</p><p>📅 11/14(土) 11:00~</p><p>🎥 配信<a href=\"https://t.co/Pw4KV9SYmC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/Pw4KV9SYmC</a><a href=\"https://t.co/2K3VycMVBx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/2K3VycMVBx</a><a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/LEGENDUS?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#LEGENDUS</a><a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/SHAKAONE?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#SHAKAONE</a><a href=\"https://t.co/UbXxU99cdv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/UbXxU99cdv</a></p><p>— LEGENDUS (@LEGENDUS_SHAKA) <a href=\"https://x.com/LEGENDUS_SHAKA/status/2118276239475753217?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 5, 2026</a></p></blockquote><p>「LEGENDUS SHAKA ONE 2026」是40名人氣實況主組成 5人1組 的隊伍，以團隊對抗方式在新東京賽道競速的SHAKA主辦卡丁車企劃。</p><p></p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/legendus-shakaone-nov2026-02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cf651e6af13acdc77c425fe495b6a320a8a015903cd8086598203cca2d09d7d1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F835b7084ad293906842046551710dec6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/legendus-shakaone-nov2026-03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1a79ecc3da3cc5c9ebd9f94589584d16a947e4704281e74b12b86a81fba8290a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F33b3f67facc11e28987540813bedaf16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>在分隊之前，將分成每8人1組的5個小組進行計時賽。<br/>行駛後由隊長進行選秀，決定5人1組的隊伍。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h3>出演者一覽</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"出演者一覽\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8b651dd13993f89ff73d7429c0ce986eac5d1a09421a9fd65ab5914fc1f1a7b1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F501a7280258f81b788b4f14456a30709.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h4>第1組</h4><figure><p><img alt=\"第1組\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/488be227bbae9f86966a4ae08c560d50c2cab9058efe76380f1967369deaa0fb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F776b3317e1edd8a289089349241ba874.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><ul><li><p>蛇足(<a href=\"https://x.com/dasoku_youtube\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@dasoku_youtube</a>)</p></li><li><p>ふぉい(<a href=\"https://x.com/Foy_honmono\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Foy_honmono</a>)</p></li><li><p>布団ちゃん(<a href=\"https://x.com/indegnasen210\" rel=\"noopener norefer